  hair: ['Hair', 'Natural hair texture is described for each constitution. Answer for untreated hair.'],
  temp: ['Temperature', 'Each dosha has a temperature quality (Vata cold, Pitta hot, Kapha cold and damp), so lifelong tolerance of heat and cold is a classical marker.'],
  appetite: ['Appetite and thirst', 'The texts describe digestive fire as irregular, sharp or slow by constitution. Answer for your usual pattern over years.'],
  digestion: ['Digestion', 'Long-term tendencies after eating, as opposed to this month\'s symptoms, which belong in the Vikriti assessment.'],
